- Both searches visit only pairs with `a <= b` and stop early once no remaining pair can match or beat the best palindrome found so far. Ties are kept so all factor pairs are reported, and four-digit ranges stay fast.
- The early-exit bounds assume non-negative factors, which is what this exercise covers.

